{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "5c74593b9443bedc85fa0bc17574e60a60960074afd83fa238dd857a9aa7b3a8", "ja": "招待状の豪華さに目を奪われちゃったけど、\n気になるのはやっぱり中身だよね……。", "zh": "虽然被邀请函的豪华程度吸引了目光，\n不过最让人在意的果然还是里面的内容呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "6288aa6247992c71d23dc6e75ac50311c62ed01009e6def24eebe5b8d1ef951c", "ja": "勝手に開けるわけにはいかないけど、\n気になる……気になるよ～！！", "zh": "虽然不能擅自打开，\n但真的好在意……好在意啊～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "85708cabdcbff3f72fad8addcafc1bdc406161a15fab34b891c96a1eae9ae147", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nこれから事務所に向かおうと思うんですが……。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n我正准备去事务所……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "571beca07c77e7e0972c22b81b4afcca58e2a42d89d392bc50df0ecdb1219127", "ja": "{$P$}さん！！\nお待ちしていました！！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！！\n一直在等您呢！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1ddefda8d66cc1175311fb3e76fe0f7382cc90f264e2a634a3514c12e3ea26f5", "ja": "うわびっくりした！！\nあ、青羽さん、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "哇，吓我一跳！！\n啊，青羽小姐，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "f14ca88bf6ac693a3ded15d20ea053ee08f2226e37159c4378e9f213f6758c33", "ja": "じつは、事務所に向かう前にお渡ししたいものが\nあるんです。この郵便物なんですけど……。", "zh": "其实，我在去事务所之前，有样东西想交给您。这封邮件……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3576312029e80a84d2415d9b1fab20d402edc9c23b30b633acf56642cbd1a776", "ja": "これは……ずいぶん豪華な招待状ですね。\n送り主は……黒井社長！？", "zh": "这……是一封相当豪华的邀请函啊。\n寄件人是……黑井社长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "3a00c9dc69793e09c2ae9089c7be5792f61474d84078ee1289d6ed459b9d6e3f", "ja": "そうなんです！　黒井社長には、以前『アイメガ』に\nお誘いしてもらったじゃないですか。", "zh": "就是这样！黑井社长之前不是邀请我们参加过《偶像大师》吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "e971d4b98d4c1f91e43298bd9e73adad8a03fe484af8a5562e983df444b41ea6", "ja": "あの時は響ちゃんと翼ちゃんが、玲音さんと詩花ちゃん\nの『ZWEIGLANZ』と、熱いステージを繰り広げて！", "zh": "那时候响和翼跟玲音小姐还有诗花\n的“ZWEIGLANZ”展开了热血澎湃的舞台对决！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "6da607bfce9dc50bec6c6de1e6d96e85ac32c47fc72735b049a0adfae3951a75", "ja": "だから、きっと今回もこう、何かすごいことへの\nお誘いじゃないかな～って思うんです！", "zh": "所以，我觉得这次肯定也是在邀请我们去做什么不得了的事情吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b842b5a94d3533565930e48c6f947a9c130139613597053dbeb5f210832cb5ff", "ja": "すごい、いいことであれば嬉しいんですがね……。\nとりあえず、中身を確認しましょう。", "zh": "要是很棒的好事，那就太好了……。\n总之，先确认一下里面是什么吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9ecc967d1885dc87bdf4a3f9ab34d0a4c6fbb0c7197cd7887ab3390b8665e1c4", "ja": "ええと、ペーパーナイフで封を切って……なになに？\n……！　これは……！！", "zh": "呃，用裁纸刀拆开封口……让我看看写了什么？\n……！这是……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "d06a997cfbbfe388031333620ff6ead245c97b2a74e55481d4a9479cb9b2d2a0", "ja": "わ、私も見てもいいですか？", "zh": "我、我也可以看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "f34712dcd861f5acd67e3a4815beef4202a4e92bacbc2183df9942ac45599892", "ja": "ええっ！？　えええええ～～っ！？", "zh": "诶！？诶诶诶诶～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "c64b532191ba9c48fbe64a81b67ca6d18d35a8fb7398cd3e3abc847392784dee", "ja": "まぁ！　961プロ主催の大型フェス、ですか！？", "zh": "哎呀！是961事务所主办的大型音乐节吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "661ce7099934ccdbe2c2f3dcfe4c01826b412472dfe6743f355620f05e9c42a3", "ja": "うむ。それに765プロからも参加しないか、\nという話のようだね。", "zh": "嗯。而且好像还在商量要不要让765事务所也参加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ba335bc4678926ac9c01ca0e51299f80a98a97ddda59355b5adef31393161a60", "ja": "はい。アイドルは指定されていて、\n響、美希、貴音の3人です。", "zh": "是的。参加的偶像已经定好了，是响、美希和贵音这3人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "76dd2dd712d125d776ff7ef75d8503f65da013835dee2a5b56192c9a05e87d0b", "ja": "まずスケジュール的には、問題ありません。\nおそらく3人も……一応、受けてくれるとは思います。", "zh": "首先在日程安排上是没有问题的。\n恐怕那3个人……大概也会愿意接下这份工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8ca5ffa04a80cd0a65e7702eedf60306e3cf816afa554003d0e76c650cc240c6", "ja": "ただ……『アイメガ』の時と違って、\n今回は961プロ主催のフェスなので……。", "zh": "不过……和『アイメガ』那次不同，\n这次是由961制作人主办的庆典……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "4a7d7fd5e7def92037c8259d5d215b4ad82938ebfead8504e2b5ccc338a016e8", "ja": "黒井社長の懐に飛び込むようなもの、ですよね。", "zh": "就像主动闯进黑井社长的怀里一样，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4718b68bc2de0b10d7c74688e97f06bc0d0477a306628384e360e54711aad43f", "ja": "はい。玲音や詩花とは仲良くさせてもらっていますが、\n黒井社長とは考え方が違いすぎる。それを思うと……。", "zh": "是的。我和玲音、诗花相处得还不错，\n但和黑井社长的想法相差太多了。想到这一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "ccaaf2ec3848ed36220086e4e40c201debe0f80f25a34bcd92fed9a885f364ec", "ja": "いいんじゃないかね、\n黒井の誘いを受けてみても。", "zh": "接受黑井的邀请，或许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "13e32cd0f4dea016ed3a58e41494b12c2e0397a5408b31b91c1aa95022a19c51", "ja": "えっ……。\n社長、いいんですか？", "zh": "诶……社长，这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "af47ddfb5a8a010c0e233a9478088a207b1a644f65b9c676d2d8c664d0fb2023", "ja": "うむ。このフェス、黒井は相当な覚悟で仕掛けるつもり\nだろう。招待されたアイドルも我々だけではあるまい。", "zh": "嗯。对于这次音乐节，黑井恐怕是下了相当大的决心\n要有所动作吧。受邀的偶像应该也不止我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "da93ec7fd84bb7da01bec8a136d45e1429479d131c7618a4214fcc3f19792193", "ja": "それに、黒井は黒井なりに考えがあるようだしね。\nたまには乗っかってみようじゃないか。", "zh": "而且，黒井似乎也有自己的想法。偶尔就顺着他一次吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "69b48b9337d395dd82ae9fc304858d04d5fe636c1d465819665d78e59c33b7e4", "ja": "乗っかって……大丈夫ですかね？", "zh": "跟着他一起做……真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "e04b2774d966e828a489a8a049f2630062385e556a63c05313432e7ad806fb69", "ja": "やつとは腐れ縁だ。こういう手紙をよこすときの彼は、\n意外と真剣なのだよ。……ま、わかりにくいがね。", "zh": "他和我有着孽缘。他写来这种信的时候，意外地很认真。……不过，确实不太容易看出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "6dd1fe02ff67d75f467d88484bacfaf27b95399ad64ddb7b7cba674c5a79a3fc", "ja": "君やアイドルたちにとっても、今回の黒井と仕事を\nするのは、おそらくいい経験になるだろう。", "zh": "对你和偶像们来说，这次能与黑井共事，\n恐怕也是一次难得的好经验吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "2d62f62cc6ccf11d2b0d3495ee8b519d5f980e98fe248c0c1d6f08c064c97064", "ja": "まぁ、たとえ黒井が何か仕掛けてきたとしても、\n君がいれば大丈夫だろう！　はっはっはっはっは！", "zh": "不过嘛，就算黑井搞了什么动作，\n有你在应该也没问题吧！哈哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "05abcdf1a595f749242a2f203226e3fbfa4973d3a86bfe9e357b6b5d05eafcf2", "ja": "……わかりました。社長がそうおっしゃるなら……。\nこの招待、受けようと思います。", "zh": "……我明白了。既然社长都这么说了……  \n我决定接受这次邀请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1033_101kot", "source_sha256": "a30b43d5642d8002f7aad99e61f7c3530d4f8ddd5a2d2ef5a5dd73d4df922f56", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n困ったことがあったら、いつでも頼ってくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。如果遇到什么困难，随时来找我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "198e41409455d2bffa1caba21476d7b41ca56d4a608e72d9465f0ff2a0dcf52c", "ja": "ありがとうございます、音無さん。\nもしもの時は頼ります。", "zh": "谢谢你，音无小姐。\n要是真遇到什么事，我会找你帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "9e9b84b46f13ec753296216ec6cb8647f165f9a9b2ab57f7378075fad2d55400", "ja": "（まさかの黒井社長からの招待状……\nそして、961プロの懐に飛び込むことになるとは）", "zh": "（没想到竟然会收到黑井社长的邀请函……\n而且还要一头扎进961事务所的怀抱。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_intro_1036_p", "source_sha256": "0b038500f724b3eca60c9ccce53901acd3750bf7d53bfa1c823c8d889ea2c7fa", "ja": "（でも臆してばかりはいられない。\n出場する以上、響たちを最高に輝かせてみせる！）", "zh": "（但也不能一直畏缩不前。\n既然要参赛，我一定要让响她们绽放出最耀眼的光芒！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
